        "subject": "We received your prescription refill request",
        "message": "=<div style=\"background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e3e8ee;\"><div style=\"background:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;padding:20px 24px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">Vitalis Health Center</div><div style=\"padding:24px;color:#1f2937;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\"><p>Dear {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.patient_name }},</p><p>We received your refill request for <b>{{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.medication }}</b>. Our care team will review it and update you within {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.risk_level === \"urgent\" ? \"a few hours\" : \"1 to 2 working days\" }}.</p><p>Please note that a clinician must approve every refill. If you are out of medication or feel unwell, call the clinic or seek emergency care.</p><p>Kind regards,<br>Vitalis Health Center</p></div></div></div>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
