        "message": "=<div style=\"background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e3e8ee;\"><div style=\"background:{{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.risk_level === \"urgent\" ? \"#b91c1c\" : \"#b45309\" }};color:#ffffff;padding:20px 24px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">Refill request: {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.risk_level }}</div><div style=\"padding:24px;color:#1f2937;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\"><table style=\"width:100%;background:#fffbeb;border-radius:6px;\" cellpadding=\"12\"><tr><td><b>Patient:</b> {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.patient_name }}<br><b>Phone:</b> {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.patient_phone }}<br><b>Email:</b> {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.patient_email }}<br><b>Medication:</b> {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.medication }} {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.dosage }}<br><b>Pharmacy:</b> {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.pharmacy }}<br><b>Patient notes:</b> {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.patient_notes }}<br><b>AI summary:</b> {{ $(\"Parse Refill Assessment\").item.json.ai_summary }}</td></tr></table><p>AI triage is advisory only. A clinician must approve the refill. After handling, set the row status to approved or declined in the refill_requests table.</p></div></div></div>",
